# Copy to .env — Vite inlines VITE_* vars at build time.
# Leave empty in development: the admin calls /api relative to its own origin and the Vite
# dev server proxies it to the API (vite.config.ts). Pointing it at http://localhost:5032
# breaks every request — the API redirects http→https and browsers reject redirected
# CORS preflights. The production build (served by the API from wwwroot) is relative too.
VITE_API_URL=
